 "amendments": {
  "items": {
   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the public authorities law, in relation to providing for the\nfinancing and construction of facilities for the New York Military Academy",
    "basePrintNo": "S8296",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8296-2017",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §§1676 & 1680, Pub Auth L",
    "lawSection": "Public Authorities Law",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S8296\n\nSPONSOR: LARKIN\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the public authorities law, in relation to providing for\nthe financing and construction of facilities for the New York Military\nAcademy\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nAuthorizes the dormitory authority to construct and finance certain\nfacilities of the New York Military Academy (NYMA).\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 & 2: Amends the public authorities law relating to the\nconstruction and financing of facilities.\n\nSection 3: Allows the Dormitory Authority be the contacting agency for\nNYMA\n\nSection 4: Effective Date\n\n \nDIFFERENCE BETWEEN ORIGINAL AND AMENDED VERSION (IF APPLICABLE):\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis legislation was introduced at the request of the New York Military\nAcademy.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNone.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS FOR STATE AND LOCAL GOVERNMENTS:\n\nNone to the State.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
